# Scheduled Task Baseline

Existing Windows scheduled tasks were reviewed before generating controlled test activity.

```powershell
Get-ScheduledTask | Select-Object -First 10 TaskName,TaskPath,State
```

This demonstrated that scheduled tasks are a normal and heavily used Windows capability.

This is important to DET-004 because:

```text
Scheduled Task Creation
        !=
Confirmed Malicious Persistence
```

Detection requires behavioral and contextual analysis.

