# Scheduled Task Hunting Query

A broader hunting query was developed to identify scheduled-task-related activity without treating every event as an alert.

```spl
index=* ("schtasks.exe" OR "Register-ScheduledTask")
```

Saved as:

```text
HUNT - Scheduled Task Activity
```

This search can identify activity associated with:

```text
schtasks.exe
Register-ScheduledTask
Scheduled-task creation
Scheduled-task queries
Scheduled-task modification
Scheduled-task deletion
Administrative scheduled-task activity
```

The hunting search intentionally provides broader visibility than DET-004.

---

# Detection vs. Hunting

```text
DET-004
   |
   v
schtasks.exe + /create
   |
   v
Scheduled Alert
```

versus:

```text
Scheduled Task Hunt
       |
       +---- schtasks.exe
       |
       +---- Register-ScheduledTask
       |
       v
Broader Analyst Review
```

Separating the alert from the hunting query reduces unnecessary alert noise.

