# Network Correlation

Network telemetry should be reviewed around suspicious task creation.

The Sprint 22 task only wrote benign text locally and was not expected to generate suspicious network traffic.

In a real investigation, network activity associated with either the task creator or task action could significantly increase investigative priority.

